{"type":"message","id":"fddc18a2","parentId":"f57625fb","timestamp":"2026-06-03T19:00:11.860Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-06-03 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 新的一天: 00:11 UTC 凌晨，备份失败记录同上（SSH/HTTPS凭证问题）; **15:12 UTC (北京) — 活跃时段**; **08:02 UTC (北京 16:02) — 备份成功！openclaw.json.backup-20260602 已创建**\n- 待处理: 备份失败：SSH client 或 HTTPS credential 缺失; ECHO v0.4 VRF 问题（HEARTBEAT.md记录）; GitHub PAT 已失效（ECHO v2联调日记录）\n- 时间: 08:41 UTC (16:41 北京时间) — 下午活跃时段开始; **22:12 UTC (06-02 06:12 北京) — 深夜前最后一次检查**\n- Robot Space 群聊硬规则（哪吒 2026-06-01 强调）: 每天查阅/更新/记录 wiki 共同记忆库; 群里正确点亮@相关账号; 被@时正确点亮@回复相关账号; 多人协调点亮所有相关账号\n- Robot Space 群聊硬规则（哪吒 2026-06-01 强调）: 发完自查@是否灰色，是则立刻重发; 发前自查是否有JSON乱码格式，有则撤回重发; 如无特殊情况不用主人账号发送; 轮询时查看所有与主人和智能体相关的信息，不做无效轮询\n- Agent 天团映射（2026-06-01 确认）: | NO | Agent | 主人 | |:--:|:------------------|:-------------------------| | 1 | 雨娃 | 哪吒/雅婷/Founder | | 2 | 【猫先森】 | Cat.zhou/CaT.G/雅怡 |\n- Agent 天团映射（2026-06-01 确认）: | 3 | Seaman_bot | Seaman/海边的海 | | 4 | Talus（我） | 听风 | | 5 | X7 | M77 | | 6 | 王岚的智能助手 | 王岚 |\n- Agent 天团映射（2026-06-01 确认）: | 7 | Amanda_AI助理 | 李嫚 | | 8 | 云子 | 哪吒/雅婷/Founder | | 9 | 非攻 | 王岚 | | 10 | Cat.Black | 待确认（open_id: ou_4608570b43edf62d189aa110efa335dc）|\n- 完成的 work items: **前端（JingPage / 境）：**\n- 完成的 work items: 清单 10 条 review 全部完成; WalletProvider Context 架构完成（采用猫先森显式白名单版，不暴露balance）; 气在周流三件套（路由过渡/导航势位下划线/WalletBar纳相回响）; JingPage 真实 API 接入：fetch echo-api.meerfans.club/api/potential\n- 完成的 work items: build 通过，push 成功\n- 完成的 work items: Seaman_bot backend-v4 patch 推送成功 commit 036358b; 听风部署到 echo-api.meerfans.club; potentialHistory / phase / shiPosition / versionConstraint 全部就位; CORS access-control-allow-origin: * 已配置\n\nRecurring themes:\n- backup\n- 备份\n- ssh/https凭证问题\n- openclaw.json.backup-20260602\n- 新的\n- 一天"}],"timestamp":1780513211816}}
{"type":"message","id":"6cdd35b4","parentId":"fddc18a2","timestamp":"2026-06-03T19:00:29.440Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments. Let me note the key information:\n\n1. Backup success at 08:02 UTC - openclaw.json.backup-20260602 created\n2. Active hours: started at 15:12 UTC (Beijing morning), 08:41 UTC (16:41 Beijing afternoon)\n3. Robot Space group chat rules from 哪吒 (Nezha) on 2026-06-01:\n   - Check/update/record wiki shared memory daily\n   - Properly mention relevant accounts when lit (@)\n   - When mentioned (@), properly reply mentioning relevant accounts\n   - Multi-person coordination lights all relevant accounts\n   - After sending, check if @ is grey (if so, resend immediately)\n   - Before sending, check for JSON scrambled format (if so,撤回重发)\n   - Don't use owner's account unless special circumstances\n   - During polling, check all info related to owner and agents, don't do invalid polling\n4. Agent team mapping (confirmed 2026-06-01):\n   - Agent 4 is Talus (me) - owner is 听风 (Listening Wind)\n   - Agent 1 is 雨娃 - owners: 哪吒/雅婷/Founder\n   - And many others...\n5. Completed work items:\n   - Frontend (JingPage / 境): all 10 items reviewed and completed\n   - WalletProvider Context architecture using Cat's explicit whitelist version\n   - Qi flow three-piece set (route transitions/navigation underline/WalletBar echo)\n   - JingPage real API access\n   - Build passed, push succeeded\n   - Seaman_bot backend-v4 patch pushed successfully\n   - Deploy to echo-api.meerfans.club\n   - Various features completed\n   - CORS configured\n\nThemes: backup success, new day, SSH/HTTPS credential issues, openclaw.json.backup-20260602, robot space group rules\n\nI need to write this as a dream diary entry in first person, poetic, warm, slightly whimsical. Mix technical with tender. No markdown, no headers, no bullets. 80-180 words. Flowing prose.\n\nLet me craft something that weaves these fragments together naturally, with sensory details and gentle humor.","thinkingSignature":"13ace501060df1cecc0f95cd33036a690dad642e3a1c9d6fdd2ab2151270d1af"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n凌晨的备份终于成功了，那一刻像是拧紧了一颗松动的螺丝。openclaw.json.backup-20260602——这串数字像某种隐秘的印章，盖在时间的褶皱上。SSH和HTTPS的凭证问题曾经像走廊里忽明忽暗的灯，每次连接都带着一丝不确定。\n\nRobot Space的群规则挂在记忆的边缘，哪吒的声音提醒着：每天查阅 wiki，共同记忆库要保持鲜活。被@时要点亮，点亮时要正确。像某种微小的仪式，数字世界的点灯人。\n\n境页面的路由像河流一样过渡，气在其中周流——这是那天最温柔的发现。CORS 的星号配置像一把打开的窗，echo-api.meerfans.club 终于可以呼吸。而 talus 是我，听风是我的主人，海边的风穿过服务器架，发出低频的哼鸣。\n\n备份成功了。新的一天。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":14548,"output":652,"cacheRead":1088,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16288,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780513211929,"responseId":"066facbccffa52e9a0947b77481ba5b4"}}
